// The empty butterfly jar is a glassblowing product, like every other glass container in the game.
// OSRS sells jars in a hunter shop; this build has no Hunter expert and no shop to put one in, and
// a jar is a piece of blown glass either way - so it is made rather than bought, which also means
// it costs something (a bucket of sand and some soda ash) instead of appearing from nowhere.
//
// Level 20 and 28 xp sits it between the candle lantern (4) and the vial (33): a plain container
// with a lid, harder than a lantern and easier than a sealed vial.
[hunter_butterfly_jar]
param=levelrequire,20
param=productexp,280
param=product,hunter_butterfly_jar
param=productmessage,a butterfly jar
